confidence_score means confidence in the anomaly_type ruling.
Rules for confidence_score (0-100): - Represents how confident you are in your ruling - True duplicates: 70-100 - Contradictions: 70-100 - Partial overlap: 70-85 (only flag Overlap when both articles answer the same specific customer query — broad topical similarity scores 0) - No relationship found: 0

